{"2233080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wizard", "steam_appid": 2233080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard is The Dark Fantasy Graphic Adventure. He helps him to find the Mystery Tower and discover the secrets fields of Wizardrym.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Wizard on this mysterious and magical Journey to the Final Destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush through the Space before the Time runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based upon the modern 80,s tale written by Gilles Villeneuve, The Wizard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of 2D Open World Slow Burn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze Runner like game, explore, find and talk to secret Characters to access secret Areas. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, cinematic, story driven and non linear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret 22 characters and 22 areas to find. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short game, about 2 hours. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an Action Combat, but Puzzle Exploration focused. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing graphics and sound. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard is a 2D Open World game inspired on the very good DOS Era genre titles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, Run, Explore. Find secret passages and characters and discover a Dark Fantasy World full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard is The Dark Fantasy Graphic Adventure. He helps him to find the Mystery Tower and discover the secrets fields of Wizardrym.  </p><p class=\"bb_p